; Control bits held after this frame's update
;
; A copy of #R$A2CF made by #R$A596 once it has computed the newly pressed bits, so at the start of that routine it
; still holds the previous frame's bits and everywhere else (the player routines) the bits held now. Same bit layout
; as #R$A2CF.
@label=ControlsHeld
g$A2D0 DEFB $00
